  "notes": [
    "DS13560 Rev 6 Table 12: PC0-PC3 do not have ADC inputs. Seven direct ADC channels assigned; main-bus voltage measured by INA228, with an independent digital validity receiver.",
    "VDD and VDDIO2 both locally AON powered; UCPD dead-battery pulldowns must be disabled during initialization.",
    "2026-10-05 control capture: PF3 repurposed from optional ADC mux reservation to MODE_LOCK_CLK; PC9 BENCH_LATCHED follows jumper before mode lock and supports startup stability polling. Physical lead/package mapping remains pending.",
    "Stage3 boundary naming: PD0/1/2 USB_REQ/BENCH_REQ/STACK_REQ; PD8 MCU_WDI; PD9 WD_RESET_VALID high means combined reset bus released; PE1 IHU_EN_VALID. PF2 hardware NRST joins MCU_NRST_N; debug reset must be open-drain. Former planning names retained as aliases."
  ],
  "reset_net": "MCU_NRST_N"
}
